{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44805","headline":"张舍人南谿别业 · 法振","name":"张舍人南谿别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新田绕屋半春耕，藜杖闲门引客行。\n山翠自成微雨色，谿花不隐乱泉声。\n渔家远到堪留兴，公府悬知欲厌名。\n入夜更宜明月满，双童唤出解吹笙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法振","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}